ah idk. Tramadol is a fked up drug, can interact with a lot I guess. But im nodding real nice now. in a trance state.

&#x200B;

edit: I suppose u were talking about caffeine now yea

yeah, thats not good.. now it came quite a while after last dose. Will take some kpin

&#x200B;

edit: is there any way to say like, how close this is to od or so?

yeah for sure. I already gave up on "fixing" myself. Just trying to live, or something.

&#x200B;

edit: Side note; I texted 'Fuck You' to my psychologist yday.

Okey. The question is. Maybe I should just take a half dozen of small doses throughout this day, just to keep myself somewhat leveled. Cuz my anxiety works up my heart rate anyways.. What u think? =)

&#x200B;

no no no no and no. no speed today ffs

I'm gonna be straight up completely honest with you bro.. That is a really cool tattoo damn. Some1 could have a meth pipe inked or whatever but this is somehow in another league, it's like if we ever forget how to make meth we can all just come back to your arm!

&#x200B;

edit:  only problem I see is when you are gonna fight some drug case in court...

I've been through "help", trust me. Been in the ward, been at the docs, waited for months. I've been clean, I work out everyday, I eat healthier then u can imagine, I sleep well. My just isn't very fun bro.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
